1
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:35,100
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:40,100
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:44,100
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:44,100 --> 00:02:49,100
Monkey D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:49,100 --> 00:02:52,100
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:55,100
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:58,100
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:58,100 --> 00:03:01,100
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:01,100 --> 00:03:04,100
Now this sight!

10
00:03:04,100 --> 00:03:07,100
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:11,100
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:15,100
the crew will cover path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:19,100 --> 00:03:23,100
After the Navy's victory in the loss of both Ace and Whitebeard,

14
00:03:23,100 --> 00:03:26,100
the war at Marineford has finally ended.

15
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,100
But this is a story from another time,

16
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:30,100
ten years ago in the East Blue,

17
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:33,100
when Luffy first met Ace.

18
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:35,100
I won't do it!

19
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:38,100
We're finished here, Brad.

20
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:41,100
Whoa!

21
00:03:41,100 --> 00:03:44,100
Let him go!

22
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:49,100
I won't run! Ace's desperate rescue operation!

23
00:03:49,100 --> 00:04:05,100
Forge-a-me! It's that damn kid!

24
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:07,100
He's got the money! That brat!

25
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:08,100
Ah!

26
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,100
Huh?

27
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:11,100
Ace! You're here!

28
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:20,100
Thanks for showing up, kid. You saved us some trouble.

29
00:04:20,100 --> 00:04:23,100
Your friend ain't squealing. He's pretty tough.

30
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:24,100
But I think you'll talk.

31
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,100
Ace!

32
00:04:25,100 --> 00:04:26,100
Sa...

33
00:04:26,100 --> 00:04:27,100
Sabo!

34
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,100
Do it!

35
00:04:28,100 --> 00:04:34,100
Boss, are you okay?

36
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:35,100
Ace!

37
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:36,100
Sabo!

38
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,100
That kind of hurt.

39
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:38,100
Who hit me?

40
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:39,100
You?

41
00:04:39,100 --> 00:04:41,100
You punks don't get who you're messing with.

42
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:42,100
Yeah.

43
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:43,100
You're all dead mean!

44
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:45,100
Shut your mouth and fight!

45
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:47,100
Sabo! Help Luffy!

46
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:48,100
You guys!

47
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:58,100
One thing, that ugly dude has a sword. Be careful!

48
00:04:58,100 --> 00:05:12,100
No way!

49
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:15,100
Orange of me, that other kid got our knife!

50
00:05:17,100 --> 00:05:20,100
Quick, make a run for it!

51
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:21,100
You go ahead.

52
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,100
What?

53
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:23,100
Ace!

54
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,100
Let's just leave!

55
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:27,100
I don't run from my enemies. Ever!

56
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,100
Got it?

57
00:05:28,100 --> 00:05:31,100
And I don't go easy on my enemies!

58
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,100
Come on!

59
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:35,100
These guys aren't just thugs! They're Blue Jam Pirates!

60
00:05:35,100 --> 00:05:37,100
Yeah, you got that right.

61
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:40,100
Now, I'm done playing games here.

62
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:42,100
You've got something that belongs to us.

63
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:45,100
Be good, and give it back, you brat!

64
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:48,100
You're just a kid, and I don't blame you for acting stupid.

65
00:05:48,100 --> 00:05:50,100
But fork over the cash or you'll regret it.

66
00:05:53,100 --> 00:05:56,100
We've got better plans for it. That's our money now.

67
00:06:00,100 --> 00:06:01,100
Then you are dead!

68
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:03,100
Hold on a sec, I'll be right back.

69
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:06,100
Oh great, not this again.

70
00:06:06,100 --> 00:06:08,100
Really like to dig your heels in, don't ya?

71
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:11,100
Shut up. Let's fight.

72
00:06:11,100 --> 00:06:13,100
That's enough of this crap!

73
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:20,100
I'm not gonna lose, ya hear?

74
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:22,100
I'd rather just kill myself!

75
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:24,100
Not if we do it first!

76
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:27,100
Come at me, you pricks!

77
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:43,100
I heard the whole damn story, Porchemy.

78
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:45,100
You should be ashamed.

79
00:06:46,100 --> 00:06:49,100
Did you seriously get beaten by a couple of kids?

80
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:52,100
Yeah. Forgive me, Captain.

81
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:54,100
The money.

82
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,100
I've heard enough of this.

83
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:59,100
You're not fit for my crew.

84
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:08,100
Now then, which one of you will get my money back?

85
00:07:09,100 --> 00:07:12,100
We gotta show those punks we're not letting it go without a fight, got it?

86
00:07:13,100 --> 00:07:14,100
Yes, Captain.

87
00:07:15,100 --> 00:07:16,100
We'll have it back right away.

88
00:07:26,100 --> 00:07:28,100
Ace, that was really not cool.

89
00:07:29,100 --> 00:07:30,100
Those guys were actual pirates.

90
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:32,100
Next time, we run.

91
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:35,100
Whatever your deal is, it's not worth dying over.

92
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:37,100
This sucks.

93
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:38,100
I like my old one better.

94
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:42,100
We made a huge mistake.

95
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,100
Pissing off pirates like that.

96
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:46,100
Man, they probably told their captain.

97
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:48,100
What are we supposed to do now?

98
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,100
That was scary!

99
00:07:50,100 --> 00:07:52,100
I thought I was gonna die!

100
00:07:55,100 --> 00:07:56,100
Would you shut up?

101
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:58,100
You're not hurt that bad.

102
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,100
So stop crying already!

103
00:08:00,100 --> 00:08:01,100
When are you gonna stop being a baby?

104
00:08:02,100 --> 00:08:03,100
Don't you wanna be a pirate?

105
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,100
Don't you wanna be a pirate?

106
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:08,100
Thank you.

107
00:08:12,100 --> 00:08:13,100
You...

108
00:08:14,100 --> 00:08:15,100
You saved me.

109
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,100
Stop it!

110
00:08:18,100 --> 00:08:19,100
Calm down.

111
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,100
He's just happy, okay?

112
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:24,100
All right.

113
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,100
What gives?

114
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:27,100
Why didn't you tell them what they wanted?

115
00:08:28,100 --> 00:08:29,100
You think they wouldn't kill you cause you're a kid?

116
00:08:29,100 --> 00:08:30,100
Those guys don't give a damn!

117
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:33,100
I was afraid...

118
00:08:34,100 --> 00:08:35,100
that...

119
00:08:35,100 --> 00:08:36,100
you wouldn't be my friend.

120
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:37,100
Yeah?

121
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:38,100
Well, so what?

122
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,100
That still beats dying, right?

123
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:41,100
Besides, why do you wanna be my friend?

124
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:42,100
That's dumb.

125
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:45,100
Because...

126
00:08:46,100 --> 00:08:47,100
It's not like I've been nice to you.

127
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:50,100
In fact, I've been giving you hell ever since we met.

128
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:51,100
It's been months.

129
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:52,100
Why haven't you just given up?

130
00:08:52,100 --> 00:08:53,100
I've just given up.

131
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,100
Well...

132
00:09:00,100 --> 00:09:01,100
Cuz...

133
00:09:01,100 --> 00:09:02,100
Cuz I...

134
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:04,100
I got no one else to turn to.

135
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,100
I can't go back to Windmill Village.

136
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:08,100
I don't like the Mountain Bandits either.

137
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,100
I'd be all alone all the time if I didn't follow you.

138
00:09:12,100 --> 00:09:13,100
Getting beat up hurts,

139
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,100
but being lonely hurts more.

140
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,100
Alone?

141
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,100
Why?

142
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:21,100
Gramps is all I have.

143
00:09:23,100 --> 00:09:24,100
You feel better around me?

144
00:09:25,100 --> 00:09:26,100
Uh-huh.

145
00:09:26,100 --> 00:09:28,100
Otherwise, you feel lonely?

146
00:09:28,100 --> 00:09:29,100
Uh-huh.

147
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:34,100
Do I think Gold Roger had a kid?

148
00:09:36,100 --> 00:09:38,100
If he did, then too bad for that poor runt.

149
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:40,100
No kidding!

150
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,100
They'd put him to death!

151
00:09:41,100 --> 00:09:42,100
He'd probably deserve it, too.

152
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:44,100
I bet.

153
00:09:50,100 --> 00:09:51,100
Do you think...

154
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,100
I deserve to live?

155
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,100
Of course I do!

156
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,100
I see.

157
00:10:04,100 --> 00:10:05,100
But you're still annoying.

158
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:07,100
Weak little crybabies piss me off.

159
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:11,100
I'm not weak!

160
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:12,100
I'm really strong!

161
00:10:13,100 --> 00:10:14,100
Ha!

162
00:10:14,100 --> 00:10:15,100
You think you're really strong?

163
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:17,100
You were crying your eyes out the whole time you were tied up.

164
00:10:17,100 --> 00:10:20,100
Have you ever gotten hit by a spiky thing that big?

165
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,100
I'm just seven years old!

166
00:10:21,100 --> 00:10:23,100
Wait till I turn ten years old like you guys,

167
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:26,100
and then I'll be stronger and won't cry anymore!

168
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:29,100
Age has nothing to do with it, you brat!

169
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:31,100
Hell, when I was seven, I was tough!

170
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,100
So what?

171
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:33,100
I'm gonna be so tough, you're gonna cry!

172
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:36,100
I promised Shanks I'd be a great pirate someday,

173
00:10:36,100 --> 00:10:37,100
and that means way greater than you!

174
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:39,100
Ha! You'll be a crappy pirate!

175
00:10:39,100 --> 00:10:40,100
Nuh-uh!

176
00:10:40,100 --> 00:10:41,100
Yeah, huh?

177
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:42,100
Nuh-uh!

178
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:45,100
Well, okay, enough of that.

179
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:47,100
Geez!

180
00:10:47,100 --> 00:10:50,100
Now listen, in case you guys forgot, we got a problem here.

181
00:10:51,100 --> 00:10:52,100
A problem?

182
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:57,100
Blue Jam and his buddies are bound to come looking for us after what happened back there.

183
00:10:57,100 --> 00:11:00,100
And like you said, they don't care if we're kids, they'll kill us without a second thought.

184
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:02,100
Yeah, probably.

185
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:07,100
This forest where I've been living is awfully close to their hideout, the Cove of Pirates.

186
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:12,100
What if one night I'm a little too tired, sleep a little too hard, and they sneak up on me?

187
00:11:13,100 --> 00:11:14,100
You're dead.

188
00:11:15,100 --> 00:11:16,100
Yeah, way dead.

189
00:11:16,100 --> 00:11:17,100
Right.

190
00:11:18,100 --> 00:11:20,100
So, I need your help.

191
00:11:21,100 --> 00:11:22,100
Here, I've got an idea.

192
00:11:32,100 --> 00:11:46,100
What's with all the bandages? Have they been fighting bears or something?

193
00:11:48,100 --> 00:11:50,100
That's not the problem.

194
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:58,100
Hey! Boss! Come quick! This isn't good!

195
00:11:58,100 --> 00:12:00,100
Give me a sec, it's early.

196
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:02,100
Huh?

197
00:12:02,100 --> 00:12:04,100
What have those breasts been up to now?

198
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:06,100
One, two...

199
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:09,100
Huh?

200
00:12:09,100 --> 00:12:11,100
One, two...

201
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:13,100
Huh?

202
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:14,100
Ace, Luffy.

203
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:16,100
Huh?

204
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:18,100
Wait a sec.

205
00:12:19,100 --> 00:12:20,100
Ace, Luffy.

206
00:12:20,100 --> 00:12:21,100
Huh?

207
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,100
Ace, Luffy.

208
00:12:23,100 --> 00:12:24,100
Huh?

209
00:12:24,100 --> 00:12:25,100
Okay.

210
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:27,100
Okay, let's work this out.

211
00:12:27,100 --> 00:12:28,100
Ace, Luffy.

212
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:29,100
Huh?

213
00:12:29,100 --> 00:12:30,100
Ace, Luffy.

214
00:12:30,100 --> 00:12:31,100
Huh?

215
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:32,100
Ace, Luffy.

216
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:33,100
Huh?

217
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:34,100
Ace, Luffy!

218
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:35,100
Who's that other kid with you?

219
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:38,100
Who's what now?

220
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,100
Come on.

221
00:12:41,100 --> 00:12:43,100
It's too early for questions.

222
00:12:43,100 --> 00:12:44,100
Pipe down, will ya?

223
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:50,100
Two brats is already too many!

224
00:12:50,100 --> 00:12:51,100
Who the hell are you?

225
00:12:53,100 --> 00:12:54,100
You mean me?

226
00:12:56,100 --> 00:12:57,100
Ugh!

227
00:12:57,100 --> 00:12:58,100
Right.

228
00:12:58,100 --> 00:12:59,100
Hi, I'm Sabo.

229
00:12:59,100 --> 00:13:00,100
Huh?

230
00:13:00,100 --> 00:13:02,100
Ace's friend, I see.

231
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:03,100
Oh good.

232
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:05,100
It's like I'm already living here.

233
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:06,100
And you must be Dadan, right?

234
00:13:07,100 --> 00:13:08,100
Hiya!

235
00:13:08,100 --> 00:13:09,100
Living here?

236
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:10,100
Listen up, kid.

237
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:12,100
Nobody said you could stay.

238
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:15,100
Don't answer me with a fart!

239
00:13:18,100 --> 00:13:20,100
Hey, quit farting in my house!

240
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:24,100
You're just as worthless as those other two low-lifes moving off me!

241
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,100
Oh yeah?

242
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:27,100
Well I heard that you're a worthless old hag yourself.

243
00:13:29,100 --> 00:13:30,100
Uh-uh!

244
00:13:30,100 --> 00:13:32,100
Pull that crap one more time and you're out of here!

245
00:13:33,100 --> 00:13:34,100
Actually, you're out anyway.

246
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:36,100
I ain't watching any more brats.

247
00:13:37,100 --> 00:13:41,100
I also heard that you're a nice old hag that wouldn't leave a kid like me to die in the woods.

248
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,100
Huh?

249
00:13:42,100 --> 00:13:45,100
And you're a tough old hag too, so I'll be sure to mind my manners.

250
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:49,100
Okay, the tough part is true, but stop calling me a hag!

251
00:13:49,100 --> 00:13:51,100
You stupid brats!

252
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:52,100
Luffy!

253
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:53,100
Ace!

254
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:54,100
Sabo!

255
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:55,100
There aren't any free rides!

256
00:13:55,100 --> 00:13:58,100
You twerps better be grateful and get to work this instant!

257
00:13:58,100 --> 00:13:59,100
You got it!

258
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:00,100
Thank you!

259
00:14:00,100 --> 00:14:01,100
You got it!

260
00:14:01,100 --> 00:14:02,100
Thank you!

261
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:31,100
See ya!

262
00:14:31,100 --> 00:14:32,100
Hey!

263
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:33,100
Get back here, Luffy!

264
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:34,100
This house ain't gonna clean itself!

265
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:35,100
Cleaning is boring!

266
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:36,100
Bleh!

267
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:37,100
Hey, Sabo!

268
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:38,100
Wait for me!

269
00:14:38,100 --> 00:14:39,100
Damn brats!

270
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,100
I should've known!

271
00:14:40,100 --> 00:14:41,100
Oops!

272
00:14:41,100 --> 00:14:42,100
Hold it!

273
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:43,100
Forgot to tell them!

274
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:44,100
Hey, Dad!

275
00:14:44,100 --> 00:14:45,100
You might get some gas later!

276
00:14:45,100 --> 00:14:46,100
We pissed off Blue Jam so he probably wants us dead!

277
00:14:46,100 --> 00:14:47,100
Play it cool, okay?

278
00:14:47,100 --> 00:14:48,100
Hold on!

279
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,100
Is this supposed to be a joke?

280
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:50,100
I'm lost!

281
00:14:50,100 --> 00:14:51,100
Huh?

