346
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:53,520
His whole body really is made of rubber.

347
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:54,640
That's neat!

348
00:16:54,820 --> 00:16:56,080
Let go of my face!

349
00:16:56,080 --> 00:17:06,700
You know, if you got into a fight, stretching, or bouncing, it might actually be kind of handy.

350
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:08,580
Uh-huh!

351
00:17:08,580 --> 00:17:10,200
